    "detailed_description": "All you wanted to do was go for a little jog, but look at this.  Someone dumped a bunch of trash in front of your house.  It'll be quite a project to clean this all up!  Start with the trash on your street corner, upgrade your capacity, and start exploring your town for other effective ways to keep it a pleasant and safe place to live.  And watch out for pollution from the factories!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOriginally started as a submission at Eco Jam for Earth Day 2022, now expanded and improved with more gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSingle player game for mouse and keyboard.  Includes exploration of your town, several methods of cleaning it up based on real-world solutions, stats screen to show your progress, and multiple ways to win.  DRM-free.",
    "about_the_game": "All you wanted to do was go for a little jog, but look at this.  Someone dumped a bunch of trash in front of your house.  It'll be quite a project to clean this all up!  Start with the trash on your street corner, upgrade your capacity, and start exploring your town for other effective ways to keep it a pleasant and safe place to live.  And watch out for pollution from the factories!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOriginally started as a submission at Eco Jam for Earth Day 2022, now expanded and improved with more gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSingle player game for mouse and keyboard.  Includes exploration of your town, several methods of cleaning it up based on real-world solutions, stats screen to show your progress, and multiple ways to win.  DRM-free.",
